---
description: TypeScript code style and testing requirements for packages/ and web/
globs: packages/**,web/**
alwaysApply: false
---

# Code Style

- TypeScript strict mode everywhere in web/
- Pure functions in packages/lifecycle/ (no I/O, no DOM, no storage)
- Explicit return types on all public functions
- No `any` type — use `unknown` with type guards
- Prefer `readonly` arrays and objects

# Testing Requirements

- packages/lifecycle/: 100% branch coverage required
- web/src/: Component tests for all UI components, integration tests for API client
- NO tests in POC/ (legacy — frozen)
